  dialogues:
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else? '
    patientReply: "Oh, yes doc! Sorry, just a bit excited. Okay, so I\u2019ve been
      feeling [symptoms]. 'D'ya think it\u2019s something serious? "
    doctorResponsePositive: Well, we will have to see! Anything else to take note
      of?
    patientReactionPositive: Oh, now that you mention it, hm... none.
    doctorResponseNegative: What's so exciting about this?
    patientReactionNegative: Oh... Alright.
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else? '
    patientReply: Is this like a murder mystery? Then first things first then, other
      than the ones you said, I'm also experiencing [symptoms].
    doctorResponsePositive: Let's solve this together!
    patientReactionPositive: Yey! I knew I can rely on you!
    doctorResponseNegative: You're sick, I'm not playing with you.
    patientReactionNegative: Killjoy.
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else? '
    patientReply: Just [symptoms], no biggie! Can I still go to the party after this?
    doctorResponsePositive: If things aren't too serious, have some fun!
    patientReactionPositive: Great! I already know what to wear.
    doctorResponseNegative: You're sick and you're thinking of going to a party?
    patientReactionNegative: Do you have to be so mean?
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else? '
    patientReply: First, you gotta listen to this, I got this theory I think a few
      aliens came to my room last night then I started getting [symptoms]. Coincidence?
    doctorResponsePositive: Aliens? Do you think you're part of a special mission?
    patientReactionPositive: Maybe!
    doctorResponseNegative: Yeah, Aliens.
    patientReactionNegative: What's wrong with you!?
